 "input": {
  "title": "Aventon Level 3",
  "handle": "aventon-level-3-1320",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Aventon Level.3 stands out as a top-tier commuter ebike, combining high-performance components with cutting-edge security and connectivity features.</p><h2 data-end=\"342\" data-start=\"258\"><span>The <strong data-end=\"23\" data-start=\"4\">Aventon Level.3</strong> is Aventon's most advanced commuter ebike to date, engineered for urban riders seeking a seamless blend of performance, technology, and security.</span><span> </span><span>With a robust <strong data-end=\"49\" data-start=\"14\">500W (sustained) rear hub motor</strong> peaking at <strong data-end=\"69\" data-start=\"61\">864W</strong>, and a <strong data-end=\"94\" data-start=\"77\">torque sensor</strong> for responsive pedal assist, the Level.3 delivers a smooth and powerful ride up to <strong data-end=\"188\" data-start=\"178\">28 MPH</strong> when unlocked to Class 3 mode.</span></h2><h3 data-end=\"554\" data-start=\"503\"><u><strong>Smart Security with the Aventon Control Unit</strong></u></h3><p data-end=\"637\" data-start=\"556\"><span>Equipped with the <strong data-end=\"48\" data-start=\"18\">Aventon Control Unit (ACU)</strong>, the Level.3 offers unparalleled security features:</span></p><ul data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"639\">\t<li data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"639\">\t<p data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"641\"><strong data-end=\"659\" data-start=\"641\">Remote Locking</strong>: <span>Secure your bike remotely via the Aventon app.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"754\" data-start=\"699\">\t<p data-end=\"754\" data-start=\"701\"><strong data-end=\"715\" data-start=\"701\">Geofencing</strong>: <span>Set virtual boundaries to receive alerts if your bike moves beyond them.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"755\">\t<p data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"757\"><strong data-end=\"773\" data-start=\"757\">GPS Tracking</strong>: <span>Monitor your bike's location in real-time.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"876\" data-start=\"813\">\t<p data-end=\"876\" data-start=\"815\"><strong data-end=\"835\" data-start=\"815\">Startup Passcode</strong>: <span>Prevent unauthorized use with a customizable passcode.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"877\">\t<p data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"879\"><strong data-end=\"909\" data-start=\"879\">Electronic Rear-Wheel Lock</strong>: <span>Immobilize the rear wheel to deter theft.</span></p>\t</li></ul><p data-end=\"1123\" data-start=\"998\"><span>These features provide peace of mind, ensuring your bike remains safe and under your control at all times.</span></p><h3 data-end=\"1150\" data-start=\"1125\"><u><strong>Performance &amp; Range</strong></u></h3><ul data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1152\">\t<li data-end=\"1204\" data-start=\"1152\">\t<p data-end=\"1204\" data-start=\"1154\"><strong data-end=\"1163\" data-start=\"1154\">Motor</strong>: <span>36V, 500W (sustained), 864W (peak) rear hub motor with 60Nm torque.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1259\" data-start=\"1205\">\t<p data-end=\"1259\" data-start=\"1207\"><strong data-end=\"1218\" data-start=\"1207\">Battery</strong>: <span>Removable 708Wh LG 21700 cell lithium-ion battery.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1312\" data-start=\"1260\">\t<p data-end=\"1312\" data-start=\"1262\"><strong data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1262\">Range</strong>: <span>Up to 70 miles on a single charge under optimal conditions.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1313\">\t<p data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1315\"><strong data-end=\"1332\" data-start=\"1315\">Charging Time</strong>: <span>Approximately 5 hours with a 4A charger.</span></p>\t</li></ul><p data-end=\"1546\" data-start=\"1421\"><span>The Level.3 ensures you can commute longer distances without range anxiety.</span></p><h3 data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1548\"><u><strong>Built for Comfort and Durability</strong></u></h3><ul data-end=\"1999\" data-start=\"1590\">\t<li data-end=\"1642\" data-start=\"1590\">\t<p data-end=\"1642\" data-start=\"1592\"><strong data-end=\"1601\" data-start=\"1592\">Frame</strong>: <span>6061 Aluminum with Gravity Cast Front Triangle.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1694\" data-start=\"1643\">\t<p data-end=\"1694\" data-start=\"1645\"><strong data-end=\"1653\" data-start=\"1645\">Fork</strong>: <span>80mm travel suspension fork with lockout.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1752\" data-start=\"1695\">\t<p data-end=\"1752\" data-start=\"1697\"><strong data-end=\"1711\" data-start=\"1697\">Drivetrain</strong>: <span>8-speed Shimano Altus with 48T crank.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1806\" data-start=\"1753\">\t<p data-end=\"1806\" data-start=\"1755\"><strong data-end=\"1765\" data-start=\"1755\">Brakes</strong>: <span>Magura MT A2 hydraulic disc brakes for reliable stopping power.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1807\">\t<p data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1809\"><strong data-end=\"1818\" data-start=\"1809\">Tires</strong>: <span>27.5\" x 2.2\" Kenda Kwick Seven-5 Sport tires with puncture protection.</span></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1999\" data-start=\"1860\">\t<p data-end=\"1999\" data-start=\"1862\"><strong data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1862\">Extras</strong>: <span>Integrated front and rear lights with turn signals, full fenders, rear rack, and a suspension seatpost for added comfort.</span></p>\t</li></ul><h3 data-end=\"2032\" data-start=\"2001\"><u><strong>Rider-Focused Technology</strong></u></h3><p data-end=\"2159\" data-start=\"2034\"><span>The <strong data-end=\"40\" data-start=\"4\">Aventon BC280 full-color display</strong> provides real-time data, including speed, battery level, and distance traveled.</span> <span>Connectivity with the Aventon app allows for ride tracking, performance monitoring, and security feature management.</span></p><p data-end=\"2201\" data-start=\"2166\"><span background-color:=\"\" color:=\"\" display=\"\" font-size:=\"\" grotesk=\"\" haas=\"\" neue=\"\" text-align:=\"\"><span>**E-Bikes are subject to a $150 assembly fee**&nbsp;</span></span></p>",
